# SQL Fundamentals

## Focus
- Core SQL querying and relational concepts
- Building correct, readable queries
- Understanding how data is filtered, grouped, and joined

## Topics Covered
- SELECT, WHERE, ORDER BY
- Aggregations and GROUP BY
- HAVING vs WHERE
- JOINs (INNER, LEFT, RIGHT, FULL)
- Subqueries

## Practice
- Tutorial-based practice using Mode Analytics
- Additional mixed practice queries
- Emphasis on correctness, formatting, and query logic

## Outcome
By the end of Week 1, I am comfortable writing foundational SQL queries and reasoning about joins, aggregations, and subqueries in PostgreSQL-style SQL.

